    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "So excited for this!\n\n\nSecond Lady Usha Vance (@SLOTUS)\n\nOUT NOW: \u201cStorytime with the Second Lady\u201d, my new podcast for kids! Join me and my special guests as they read good books out loud and share why they love to read. Episodes are available on YouTube and Spotify!\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/SLOTUS/status/2038588810921996517#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2038713253769924956",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-30T20:21:31+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Join us live right now! piped.video/live/H690XiEukns\n\n\n\nMeghan McCain (@MeghanMcCain)\n\nI am officially back from maternity leave and returning to Citizen McCain for my first episode back!!\n\nJoin me, @mirandali &amp; @secupp live at 12pm ET \ud83e\udde1\ud83e\ude77\npiped.video/H690XiEukns\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/MeghanMcCain/status/2038645127887859761#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2038649182731342210",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-30T16:06:56+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I am officially back from maternity leave and returning to Citizen McCain for my first episode back!!\n\nJoin me, @mirandali &amp; @secupp live at 12pm ET \ud83e\udde1\ud83e\ude77\npiped.video/H690XiEukns",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2038645127887859761",
